WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Misa ifreyimu emthambekeni bese umaka lapho intambo inqamula khona isigxobo.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.500
Jikisa ifreyimu ukuze imilenze ishintshane izindawo ezindaweni ezimbili ezifanayo ngqo, bese uphinda umaka.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.542
Uphawu lokulinganisa luphakathi nendawo kwalezo zimpawu ezimbili.

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:29.792
Hambisa omunye umlenze ukhuphuke noma wehle emthambekeni kuze kube intambo ilenga phezu kophawu lokulinganisa.
